OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fwith clear spells at first and an
OL,7,Fearly frost. Turning cloudier through
OL,8,Fthe evening and overnight but staying
OL,9,Fmostly dry, with just the odd shower
OL,10,Ffrom the east.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FIt will be cloudy throughout
OL,13,Fthe day with outbreaks of rain and
OL,14,Fhill snow, turning heavy at times.
OL,15,FBreezy around the coast with fresh
OL,16,Feasterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
